I agree.  

Such a cap already exists, but only for nurses.  The absolute limit is 
25*XL HP, but because of diminishing returns it is not practically 
obtainable.  For instance, at 15*XL HP, MaxHP increases only work half 
the time, and the chances get worse rapidly.

mhitu.c, 1399-1400:

    if (u.uhpmax < 5 * u.ulevel + d(2 * u.ulevel, 10))
				u.uhpmax++;

If this formula were to be applied to alchemy, golden glows, etc, I would 
replace "u.ulevel" with "min(20, u.ulevel)", because IMO the game already 
provides enough incentives to reach XL30.


